## Your next tool deserves a second look.

Before adding another subscription, check for a free alternative, an eligible perk, a useful trial, or developer credits.

This repository brings CupAut's public offer listings into a browsable handbook, with practical guidance for choosing tools and checking eligibility.

> **Read this first**
>
> Browsing CupAut is free. A one-time **₹1 payment unlocks one individual offer's code, claim link, and redemption instructions** in your CupAut account. It does not buy the provider's software, unlock every offer, or create a recurring CupAut subscription. Provider eligibility and terms apply; approval and savings are not guaranteed. Many listed providers offer free tools independently of CupAut.

