## Choose the right kind of offer

| Offer type | What it means | Check before using |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Free plan / free resource | A provider's free tier, open-source tool, or free-access resource | Usage limits, license, geographic restrictions |
| Promo code | A code-based promotion | Eligible plans, expiry, new-customer requirements |
| Credits | A usage allowance, not cash | Expiry, eligible services, overage billing |
| Discount | A reduction subject to conditions | Final checkout price, billing period, renewal price |
| Trial | Time-limited access | Card requirements, cancellation deadline, auto-renewal |

## Complete offer directory

**Snapshot: 24 October 2026.** This directory contains **199 individual offer links across 153 resource pages**, retrieved from CupAut's public sitemap and catalog. Of these, **194 were marked active and 5 were marked expired** at retrieval.

“Active” is a catalog label, **not an independent verification of successful redemption**. Coupon codes, discounts, free plans, credits, and trials are not interchangeable. Titles below reproduce public listing titles; numeric benefits and eligibility claims should be checked on the linked page and with the provider.

Each offer link opens its CupAut resource page at the relevant offer section. Redemption details may require the separate ₹1 per-offer unlock. No locked codes or paid instructions are reproduced here.

